[b]TLDR:[/b] Collapsible Cabinet Action Descriptions by Default, Scrollable Age Event Advances Lists!
[h1]Flavorium Universalis — UI Fixes[/h1]

An optional UI submod made originally for [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3737705389]Flavorium Universalis[/url]. but useful in any modset.

[i]Standalone-friendly — these are interface-only overrides and work alongside the base mod or on their own.[/i]

[b]Compatible with Glorp UI if that's also your flavor[/b]
[hr][/hr]

[h2]What it changes[/h2]

[h3]Collapsible Cabinet Action Descriptions[/h3]
Adds a toggle button to the cabinet interaction panel that shows or hides the modifier and effect descriptions on each action card. Hidden by default for compact, single-row cards; expand when you want the detail. The setting is stored per-country and persists across panel openings and save/load within a campaign.

[h3]Scrollable Age Event Advances[/h3]
The age event window's per-branch advance lists are now contained in a fixed-height scrollable area. Long advance lists no longer overflow the window or push the branch-selection button off-screen — overflow scrolls instead.

[hr][/hr]

[h2]What it doesn't change[/h2]

[list]
[*] No gameplay, balance, or content changes — interface only
[*] Nothing from the other Flavorium submods
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

[i]Feedback on the UI changes is welcome on the discussion page.[/i]
